### Billing overview
GET http://localhost:8080/api/billing/overview
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Top up — 409 PAYMENT_METHOD_NOT_CONFIGURED until PAYME_ENABLED / PAYME_MERCHANT_ID / PAYME_KEY are set.
# The answer's paymentId is what the callbacks below name as payment_id / merchant_trans_id.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/billing/topup
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "amountUzs": 50000,
  "paymentMethod": "PAYME"
}

### Top up through Click — 409 until CLICK_* is set
POST http://localhost:8080/api/billing/topup
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "amountUzs": 50000,
  "paymentMethod": "CLICK"
}

### Payme — CheckPerformTransaction. The IntelliJ client encodes "Basic <user> <password>" itself;
# the password is PAYME_KEY. Amounts are in tiyin: 50 000 UZS = 5 000 000.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/billing/payme/callback
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic Paycom {{payme_key}}

{"method": "CheckPerformTransaction", "params": {"amount": 5000000, "account": {"payment_id": "{{payment_id}}"}}, "id": 1}

### Payme — CreateTransaction (time = Payme's own creation time, epoch ms)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/billing/payme/callback
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic Paycom {{payme_key}}

{"method": "CreateTransaction", "params": {"id": "63f0a1b2c3d4e5f601234567", "time": 1789400000000, "amount": 5000000, "account": {"payment_id": "{{payment_id}}"}}, "id": 2}

### Payme — PerformTransaction: credits the balance; sending it again answers the same, credits nothing
POST http://localhost:8080/api/billing/payme/callback
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic Paycom {{payme_key}}

{"method": "PerformTransaction", "params": {"id": "63f0a1b2c3d4e5f601234567"}, "id": 3}

### Payme — CheckTransaction
POST http://localhost:8080/api/billing/payme/callback
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic Paycom {{payme_key}}

{"method": "CheckTransaction", "params": {"id": "63f0a1b2c3d4e5f601234567"}, "id": 4}

### Payme — CancelTransaction: -31007 once performed
POST http://localhost:8080/api/billing/payme/callback
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic Paycom {{payme_key}}

{"method": "CancelTransaction", "params": {"id": "63f0a1b2c3d4e5f601234567", "reason": 3}, "id": 5}

### Payme — GetStatement
POST http://localhost:8080/api/billing/payme/callback
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic Paycom {{payme_key}}

{"method": "GetStatement", "params": {"from": 1789300000000, "to": 1789500000000}, "id": 6}

### Payme — wrong key: -32504, still HTTP 200
POST http://localhost:8080/api/billing/payme/callback
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic Paycom wrong-key

{"method": "CheckTransaction", "params": {"id": "x"}, "id": 7}

### Click — Prepare. sign_string = md5(click_trans_id + service_id + CLICK_SECRET_KEY + merchant_trans_id
# + amount + action + sign_time), every value exactly as sent (amount "50000.00" stays "50000.00").
POST http://localhost:8080/api/billing/click/prepare
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

click_trans_id=2003&service_id={{click_service_id}}&click_paydoc_id=1&merchant_trans_id={{payment_id}}&amount=50000.00&action=0&error=0&error_note=Success&sign_time=2026-09-14 10:00:00&sign_string={{click_prepare_sign}}

### Click — Complete. merchant_prepare_id comes from Prepare's answer and joins the sign after merchant_trans_id.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/billing/click/complete
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

click_trans_id=2003&service_id={{click_service_id}}&click_paydoc_id=1&merchant_trans_id={{payment_id}}&merchant_prepare_id={{merchant_prepare_id}}&amount=50000.00&action=1&error=0&error_note=Success&sign_time=2026-09-14 10:00:05&sign_string={{click_complete_sign}}

### Free trial of a self-registered company (data is null when it never had one)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/billing/trial
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
